    <string name="ActivityMore_HowToInstructions">Point mode: long press where you want to be located in the map and press Apply. The location will be mocked one or more times according to the configuration below. While the mock is running, long press the map to jump to another place. Route mode: long press the map to add waypoints in order, set the speed and loop mode, and press Apply to move along the route. The mock keeps running in the background; pause or stop it from the notification. Use ★ to save and reload places and routes (long press an item to delete it). Note: you must select Fake Traveler+ as mock location app in Developer options.</string>
